Dental-VLA canonical scene — surgeon-interaction handover (assist openarm)
==========================================================================
사양서 v1.4 (§9 transfer volume · §10 hand-off · §20-2 Arm A/B 분리) 정합.
어시스트 openarm이 "환자를 사이에 두고 술자에게 기구를 전달"하는 구조.

Top-down (arms/pedestal at world origin, reaching +x; patient crosswise on y):

     +y  ASSISTANT zone ─ [ TRAY ]     (Arm B: 트레이·S 만)
          [ S staging ]
     0    ── OpenArm base ──  [ V transfer ] ── patient chest/chin
     -y  OPERATOR zone ── patient FACE (NO-FLY) ── surgeon hand (Arm A: V·S)

Face/head sits at -y BEYOND the arm reach bubble → arms never pass over the
face (no-fly). Handover happens in V over chin→chest, reachable by Arm A.

Benchmark predicate geometry (sites):
  V_zone / nofly_zone / stage_next / stage_used / surgeon_hand
  landmark_C (chin) / landmark_E (eye) / surgical_site (mouth)
  per-instrument R (robot grasp, blue) / O (operator grasp, amber) / W (working end, red)
Instruments are first-pass primitives (roadmap 1차). 'home' keyframe: tools/build_scene.py.
-->

